# --- API nueva (genérica) ----------------------------------------------

## Combina `xs` e `ys` con `f` hasta la lista más corta.
##
## ## Ownership
## `xs` e `ys` solo se leen; el resultado es una lista nueva.
##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
## weave add with a as int, b as int into int:
##     return a + b
##
## var sums as list of int is calling tally.zip_with with xs, ys, add
## ```
weave zip_with shard T and U and V with xs as list of T, ys as list of U, f as weave with a as T, b as U into V into list of V:
    var na as int is calling xs.len
    var nb as int is calling ys.len
    var limit as int is na
    if nb < limit:
        set limit is nb
    var idxs as list of int is list of int
    var i as int is 0
    while i < limit:
        calling idxs.push with i
        set i is i + 1
    for k in idxs then (calling f with (xs at k), (ys at k))

## Divide `xs` en tramos consecutivos de `span` elementos; el último puede ser
## más corto. `span <= 0` devuelve una lista vacía.
weave chunk shard T with xs as list of T, span as int into list of list of T:
    var n as int is calling xs.len
    if span <= 0:
        return for x in xs when false then x
    var ranges as list of list of int is list of list of int
    var c as int is 0
    while c < n:
        var inner as list of int is list of int
        var stop as int is (if (c + span) < n then (c + span) else n)
        var i as int is c
        while i < stop:
            calling inner.push with i
            set i is i + 1
        calling ranges.push with inner
        set c is stop
    for r in ranges then (for i in r then (xs at i))

## Ventanas deslizantes de ancho `width`; `width <= 0` o mayor que la lista
## devuelve una lista vacía.
weave windowed shard T with xs as list of T, width as int into list of list of T:
    var n as int is calling xs.len
    if width <= 0:
        return for x in xs when false then x
    if width > n:
        return for x in xs when false then x
    var ranges as list of list of int is list of list of int
    var c as int is 0
    var last_start as int is (n - width)
    while c <= last_start:
        var inner as list of int is list of int
        var j as int is 0
        while j < width:
            calling inner.push with (c + j)
            set j is j + 1
        calling ranges.push with inner
        set c is c + 1
    for r in ranges then (for i in r then (xs at i))

## Escaneo acumulativo con `f`, sembrado con el primer elemento.
##
## El resultado tiene la misma longitud que `xs`; `out[0] = xs[0]`.
weave scan_left shard T where T: Num with xs as list of T, f as weave with acc as T, x as T into T into list of T:
    var n as int is calling xs.len
    if n == 0:
        return for x in xs then x
    var out as list of T is for x in xs then (xs at 0)
    var i as int is 0
    while i < n:
        set out at i is (calling f with (if i > 0 then (out at (i - 1)) else donum T), (xs at i))
        set i is i + 1
    out

## Sumas acumuladas (prefijos) de `xs`.
weave running_sum shard T where T: Num with xs as list of T into list of T:
    var n as int is calling xs.len
    if n == 0:
        return for x in xs then x
    var out as list of T is for x in xs then (xs at 0)
    var i as int is 0
    while i < n:
        set out at i is ((xs at i) + (if i > 0 then (out at (i - 1)) else donum T))
        set i is i + 1
    out

## Mínimo y máximo como lista de dos elementos `[min, max]`; vacía devuelve `[]`.
weave min_max with xs as list of int into list of int:
    var out as list of int is list of int
    if (calling xs.len) == 0:
        return out
    var lo as int is xs at 0
    var hi as int is xs at 0
    for x in xs:
        if x < lo:
            set lo is x
        if x > hi:
            set hi is x
    calling out.push with lo
    calling out.push with hi
    return out

## Pares `[índice, valor]` de `xs`, en orden.
weave enumerate_pairs with xs as list of int into list of list of int:
    var out as list of list of int is list of list of int
    var i as int is 0
    for x in xs:
        var pair as list of int is list of int
        calling pair.push with i
        calling pair.push with x
        calling out.push with pair
        set i is i + 1
    return out

## Particiona `xs` con `predicate`: `[cumplen, no_cumplen]`.
weave partition_by with xs as list of int, predicate as weave with x as int into bool into list of list of int:
    var yes as list of int is list of int
    var no as list of int is list of int
    for x in xs:
        if calling predicate with x:
            calling yes.push with x
        else:
            calling no.push with x
    var out as list of list of int is list of list of int
    calling out.push with yes
    calling out.push with no
    return out

## Frecuencia de cada valor de `xs` como mapa valor -> conteo.
weave frequencies with xs as list of int into map of int to int:
    var m as map of int to int is map of int to int
    for x in xs:
        calling m.put with x, ((calling m.get with x) + 1)
    return m

## @deprecated Use `frequencies` instead.
##
## Alias de `frequencies`.
weave group_count with xs as list of int into map of int to int:
    return calling frequencies with xs

# --- Helpers privados ---------------------------------------------------

## Harness interno: panickea con `label` si `cond` es falso.
weave _expect with cond as bool, label as string into void:
    if not cond:
        calling spark.panic with "tally test failed: {label}"

## Harness interno: igualdad de enteros.
weave _expect_eq_int with actual as int, expected as int, label as string into void:
    if actual != expected:
        calling spark.panic with "tally test failed: {label}: {(actual to string)} != {(expected to string)}"

## Harness interno: igualdad de flotantes.
weave _expect_eq_float with actual as float, expected as float, label as string into void:
    if actual != expected:
        calling spark.panic with "tally test failed: {label}"

## Harness interno: igualdad de booleanos.
weave _expect_eq_bool with actual as bool, expected as bool, label as string into void:
    if actual != expected:
        calling spark.panic with "tally test failed: {label}"


